pacts him if you stretch out  those payments if it's a big company  they're not gonna care right you try to  stretch it as well as long as you can  because you're not really going to have  an impact on their business they won't  they won't act any faster if you have a  crisis if you pay them right away or not  you don't have a strong relationship so  they're not going to be impacted as much  so I say try to negotiate as great a  deal as you can with the bigger  companies but the little guys are try to  pay  you can hope for the helps answer your  question I'd love to hear what you guys  have to think if you want to leave a  comment in the video or you have your  own thoughts or your own question please  leave a comment and if you like the  video please give it a thumbs up I love  seeing those come in and it makes me  want to do more of these videos for you  guys so thank you and we'll see you on  the next episode  you
 

